mplates/individual-mle-ci.csv", "src/Bristlecone/templates/individual-mle.csv", "src/Bristlecone/templates/individual-n-step-ahead.csv", "src/Bristlecone/templates/individual-series.csv", "src/Bristlecone/templates/individual-trace.csv", "tests/Bristlecone.Benchmark/Bristlecone.Benchmark.fsproj", "tests/Bristlecone.Benchmark/Program.fs", "tests/Bristlecone.Benchmark/TestFunctions.fs", "tests/Bristlecone.Benchmark/paket.references", "tests/Bristlecone.Tests/Bristlecone.Tests.fsproj", "tests/Bristlecone.Tests/Bristlecone.fs", "tests/Bristlecone.Tests/Config.fs", "tests/Bristlecone.Tests/Dendro.fs", "tests/Bristlecone.Tests/Integration.fs", "tests/Bristlecone.Tests/Language.fs", "tests/Bristlecone.Tests/ModelSelection.fs", "tests/Bristlecone.Tests/Objective.fs", "tests/Bristlecone.Tests/Optimisation.fs", "tests/Bristlecone.Tests/Parameter.fs", "tests/Bristlecone.Tests/Program.fs", "tests/Bristlecone.Tests/Solver.fs", "tests/Bristlecone.Tests/Tensors.fs", "tests/Bristlecone.Tests/Test.fs", "tests/Bristlecone.Tests/Time.fs", "tests/Bristlecone.Tests/Workflow.fs", "tests/Bristlecone.Tests/paket.references"], "readme": "<img style=\"width:27em\" src=\"docs/img/logo-wide.png\" alt=\"Bristlecone logo\" />\n\n---\n\n![NuGet Downloads]([REDACTED]\n[![GitHub Actions Workflow Status]([REDACTED]\n[REDACTED]\n[![status](https://joss.theoj.org/papers/7f25042ea9d9d8fc66727541325c3f75/status.svg)](https://joss.theoj.org/papers/7f25042ea9d9d8fc66727541325c3f75)\n\nAn F# library for model-fitting model-selection (MFMS) of time-series models to observational data. Included is expressive modelling system for authoring models, which includes full F# units of measure support.\n\nBristlecone contains specialist functionality for fitting (long-term) ecological models. The library was developed for use in dendroecology and palaeoecology, but can be used for other time-series modelling problems.\n\n---\n\n## NuGet \n\nPackage | Stable | Prerelease\n--- | --- | ---\nBristlecone | [![NuGet Version]([REDACTED] | [![NuGet Version]([REDACTED]\nBristlecone.Dendro | [![NuGet Version]([REDACTED] | [![NuGet Version]([REDACTED]\n\n---\n\nGetting Started\n----------------\n\n<img align=\"right\" style=\"padding:0 0 1em 1em\" src=\"docs/img/logo.png\" alt=\"Bristlecone logo\" />\n\nTo get started with Bristlecone, see [the documentation website with tutorials, examples and API specification](https://andrewiom.github.io/bristlecone).\n\nSome examples are provided on the docs page, with optional downloadable worked notebooks.\n\n#### Benchmarks\n\nA suite of benchmarks - covering optimisation methods and ecological time-series models - are included in the `test/Bristlecone.Benchmark` project. The most recent results of the benchmark tests [are here](benchmarks.md).\n\n\nDevelopers: Build Instructions\n----------------\n\nBristlecone requires the .NET 10 SDK, and uses [FAKE](https://fake.build) for building, testing, documentation, and publishing. \n\nSimple building and testing can be done using ``dotnet build`` or ``dotnet run test/Bristlecone.Tests/Bristlecone.Tests.fsproj`` respectively in the root directory. Docs can be tested by first calling ``dotnet tool restore`` then\n``dotnet fsdocs watch --eval``, which serves them on a Suave server.\n\nThe full build process can be run using either ``dotnet fsi build.fsx``, which uses FAKE to run all build steps,\ntests, and compile docs.\n\nContribute\n----------------\n\nContributions, issues, and pull-requests are welcome.\n\n\n*Logo based on [Free Vector Art by www.vecteezy.com](https://vecteezy.com)*\n", "readme_present": true, "readme_scrub": {"leaked": true, "hits": {"badge_image": 1, "badge_url": 6}}, "signals": {"dependency_manifest": [], "container": [], "build_script": [], "ci_config": [".github/workflows/draft-pdf.yml"], "licence": ["LICENSE"], "tests": ["tests/Bristlecone.Benchmark/Bristlecone.Benchmark.fsproj"]}, "readme_referenced_paths": ["benchmarks.md"], "pushed_at": "2026-08-27T18:28:08Z", "created_at": 